  "shareUrn": "urn:li:share:7492899911362019328",
  "text": "I'm looking for a new opportunity! Are you hiring for Python, backend, platform, or forward-deployed engineering roles? \n\nI have 10 years of experience in IT: half in backend and full-stack development, half in technical support. Most recently I was at Ataccama, a SaaS product scaleup, where I owned an SDK for data engineers and before that I worked on a data visualization tool backend. \nAlong the way: SDKs, microservices, internal tools, infra, Kubernetes, deployments, and a lot of talking to customers.\n\nYou might also know me from organizing EuroPython, PyCon CZ, Python Pizza and Prague Python meetups, hosting the Behind the Commit podcast, or speaking at international conferences.\n\nLooking for roles in Warsaw, Prague, or remote within the EU. If your team is hiring, I'd love an intro! 🐍",
